

# WEB5020 - Assignment Part 2

Welcome to the repository for **Assignment Part 2** of the **WEB5020** module. This project builds upon foundational web development concepts, focusing on enhanced styling, layout structure, and responsive design features.

---

## 🚀 Project Overview

This web project includes customized stylesheets, image assets, and documentation outlining the development progress.

### 📂 Repository Structure

```text
N.Mkhundlu-WEB5020-Assignment-Part-2-main/
│
├── CSS/
│   └── style.css          # Main stylesheet for layout and design
├── IMAGES/                # Directory for project images and graphics
│   ├── Car-infographic.jpg
│   └── ...                # Other visual assets
├── Changelog              # Record of project updates and version history
└── README.md              # Project documentation

```

---

## 🛠️ Built With

* **HTML5** – Semantic structure of web pages
* **CSS3** – Styling, layout design, and responsive elements
* **Git & GitHub** – Version control and repository management

---

## ⚙️ Getting Started

To view or run this project locally on your machine, follow these simple steps:

1. **Clone the repository:**
```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/N.Mkhundlu-WEB5020-Assignment-Part-2.git

```


2. **Navigate to the project directory:**
```bash
cd N.Mkhundlu-WEB5020-Assignment-Part-2-main

```


3. **Open the project:**
* Open the main HTML file in your preferred web browser, or launch it using an IDE like **Visual Studio Code**.



---

## 📝 Features & Enhancements

* **Responsive Design:** Styled to adapt cleanly across various screen sizes.
* **Custom Styling:** Main stylesheet (`style.css`) structured for maintainability and visual hierarchy.
* **Infographics & Assets:** Integrated visual aids and custom images to enhance content delivery.

